---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Disclaimer | VT Analyzer";
const description = "Important limitations on the YouTube thumbnail scores and suggestions provided by VT Analyzer.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} path="/disclaimer/">
  <section class="bg-void py-14 text-mist">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-mist/50">Last updated: July 1, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8 px-5 py-16 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70 dark:text-smoke sm:text-base">
    <p>
      Please read this disclaimer carefully before using our YouTube thumbnail analyzer. Using the
      Service means you accept the terms below.
    </p>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">1. Not Professional Advice</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Scores, previews, and suggestions from VT Analyzer are provided for general informational
        and educational purposes only. They are generated algorithmically and should not be treated
        as professional design, marketing, or legal advice.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">2. No Guarantee of Results</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        We do not guarantee that using our suggestions will increase your click-through rate, video
        views, subscriber count, search ranking, or monetization. Video performance on YouTube
        depends on many factors outside a thumbnail — including content quality, YouTube's
        algorithm, audience retention, and market conditions — that are beyond our control.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">3. Educational Tool, Not a Final Authority</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Treat your score as one input into your creative process, not the deciding factor. We
        encourage using YouTube Studio's built-in thumbnail A/B testing feature alongside our
        analyzer to validate real-world performance with your actual audience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">4. Accuracy of Analysis</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        While we aim for reliable, consistent scoring, automated image analysis has inherent
        limitations and may not capture every nuance of an effective thumbnail, such as how well it
        represents your specific content or audience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">5. Your Responsibility</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        You are solely responsible for the thumbnails you create and publish, including ensuring
        they comply with YouTube's Community Guidelines and any applicable copyright or trademark
        law. Running an image through our analyzer does not transfer any responsibility for its
        content, accuracy, or compliance to VT Analyzer.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">6. Not Affiliated with YouTube or Google</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        VT Analyzer is an independent, third-party tool. We are not affiliated with, sponsored by,
        or endorsed by YouTube, Google LLC, or any of their subsidiaries. "YouTube" and related
        marks referenced on this site are the trademarks of their respective owners and are used
        here only to describe the platform our tool is designed to support, under nominative fair
        use. References to third-party tools such as Canva, Photoshop, or ChatGPT are similarly
        used for descriptive purposes only and imply no partnership.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">7. Advertising &amp; Third-Party Content</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        This site may display third-party advertisements, including through Google AdSense, and
        may link out to external tools, articles, or resources mentioned in our guides and FAQ. We
        do not control and are not responsible for the content, claims, availability, or privacy
        practices of advertisements or external sites. Inclusion of a link or ad does not imply our
        endorsement of the linked product or service.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">8. Errors &amp; Omissions</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        While we make a genuine effort to keep our FAQ, guides, and specifications (such as
        YouTube's recommended thumbnail dimensions and file-size limits) accurate and current,
        platform requirements can change without notice. We are not liable for any errors,
        omissions, or outdated information on this site, and we encourage creators to verify
        critical specifications directly against YouTube's official Creator help documentation
        before publishing.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">9. Fair Use of the Service</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        The analyzer is intended for individual, good-faith use in evaluating your own thumbnail
        designs. Automated or bulk use that places excessive load on the Service, or use intended
        to reverse-engineer our scoring methodology for a competing product, falls outside the
        intended and permitted use of this free tool.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-fog">Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Questions about this disclaimer? Email
        <a href="mailto:vtanalyze@gmail.com" class="text-red underline underline-offset-2">vtanalyze@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
